# llama.cpp.35B.moe ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** llama.cpp fork with experimental MoE offload/prefetch optimizations.

**LEONES status:** P2.

## Summary

The fork investigates prefill and expert-access improvements for Qwen MoE models, including pinned mmap CPU weights and CUDA stream prefetch.

## ODS fit

Its value is primarily as a low-VRAM MoE reference and as evidence that expert-specific optimizations can be integrated into the llama.cpp family.

The long-term ODS strategy should continue tracking upstream llama.cpp expert paging so that experimental forks do not need to become permanent dependencies.